    "long_instructions": "### Investigate\r\n\r\nRun the code again and look at the output.\r\n \r\n**Trace it:** Using order of operations, what value does total_cents store after line 9 runs? Finish the comment on line 10 with your answer.\r\n \r\n**Tinker:** On line 14, remove str() from around per_person so the line reads print(\"Each person pays: $\" + per_person / 100). Run the code. What error do you get, and why? Put str() back before moving on.\r\n \r\n**Comment it:** Finish the comment on line 13, explaining what % is telling you about leftover_cents.\r\n \r\nOpen `Investigate.txt` and respond to the prompts there.",
